  "releaseNotes": "Adds EmTabStrip, a shared tab strip control for switching panels within one screen, together with shared styles for a tab strip menu button and cascading menus. The reload button on a tab of the multi-tab main window now follows the navigation's IsReloadVisible switch, like the single-page toolbar.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.9/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Wpf.Core/0.1.0-alpha.9.md",
